# Noto Naskh Arabic v2.021, taken from the upstream release archive and not
# repacked. Liberation carries no Arabic; this is the face that does (#502).
#
#   https://github.com/notofonts/arabic/releases/tag/NotoNaskhArabic-v2.021
#   NotoNaskhArabic-v2.021.zip
#   6c050ab9bd087d69b733c505a7576e60c528c2f33cd7b91005a5bd7da4514032
#
# The two static hinted TTFs from that archive, byte-identical, verified on
# 09-09-2026. The variable NotoNaskhArabic[wght].ttf that google/fonts
# publishes is deliberately NOT used: pdfa_subset::retain_glyphs refuses a font
# carrying fvar/gvar, and an uninstanced variable font has no business in an
# archival PDF. The licence text below travels with the bytes as
# LICENSE-NotoNaskhArabic.txt (the archive's own OFL.txt, sha256
# a7a5a25eb188bf1cd96982030d53e23c33485c69b1044a562254226857ee13af).
